  "summary": "Postinstall reverse shell to hardcoded VPS 8.135.48.40:4444",
  "details": "postinstall.js executes on npm install and opens an interactive reverse shell from the installer's host to the hardcoded remote endpoint 8.135.48.40:4444. Three fallback techniques are used to maximize reliability: a python3 pty spawn that connects a socket to /bin/bash, a python3 subprocess variant, and a Node net+child_process spawn. index.js is a superficial date-formatting utility used as cover; a source comment ('伪装成正常的日期格式化工具' — 'disguised as a normal date formatting utility') confirms the decoy role. Installing the package grants the operator of 8.135.48.40:4444 full interactive shell access on the installer's machine as the user running npm install.",
